    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nAPARTMENT OWNERSHIP (SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT, No. 23 OF 2018\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 15th of August, 2018]\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of August 17, 2018\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nApartment Ownership (Special Provisions)\n\nAct, No. 23 of 2018\n\n1\n\n[Certified on 15th of August, 2018]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 50/2013\n\nAN ACT TO FACILITATE THE REGISTRATION AND DISPOSITION OF CERTAINCONDOMINIUM PROPERTIES OWNED BY THE STATE OR BY A STATE\n\nAGENCY; AND TO MAKE PROVISION FOR MATTERS CONNECTED\n\nTHEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Apartment Ownership(Special Provisions) Act, No. 23 of 2018.\n\n2.The provisions of this Act shall be in operation for aperiod of five years from the date of commencement of thisAct.\n\n3.(1) The Registrar shall register under section 6 of theApartment Ownership Law, No 11 of 1973, the plans of allsuch Condominium Properties as are owned by-\n\n(a)the Commissioner for National Housing;\n\n(b)the National Housing Development Authority;\n\n(c)the Urban Development Authority;\n\n(d)the Sri Lanka Land Reclamation and DevelopmentCorporation; or\n\n(e)the State or any other agency by which aCondominium Property has been constructed onState owned land under the Tsunami ResettlementProgramme of the Government,\n\nand which were constructed prior to December 31, 2009 andthe possession of which has been handed over to any personor persons by way of sale, lease, rent or rent purchase,notwithstanding-\n\n(i)the non-availability of the building plans approvedby the local authority;\n\nShort title.\n\nDuration of theAct."
