    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nAPPROPRIATION (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 32 OF 2017\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 14th of December, 2017]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of December 15, 2017\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nAppropriation (Amendment) Act, No. 32 of 20171\n\n[Certified on 14th of December, 2017]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 58/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE APPROPRIATION ACT, NO. 24 OF 2016\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Appropriation(Amendment) Act, No. 32 of 2017.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 24 of 2016 ishereby amended in subsection (1) of that section, by thesubstitution in paragraph (b) of that subsection for the words\u201cshall not exceed rupees one thousand five hundred seventynine billion one hundred ten million four hundred thirty sixthousand\u201d, of the words \u201cshall not exceed rupees one thousandsix hundred twenty nine billion\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nPL 010520 \u20142962 (12/2017)\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\nAmendment ofsection 2 of Act,No. 24 of 2016.\n\nAppropriation (Amendment) Act, No. 32 of 20172"
