    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nURBAN COUNCILS (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 21 OF 2017\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 12th of October, 2017]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of October 13, 2017\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1Urban Councils (Amendment)Act, No. 21 of 2017\n\n2\u2014PL 010334\u20142,962 (09/2017)\n\n[Certified on 12th of October, 2017]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 50/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE URBAN COUNCILS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 255)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Urban Councils(Amendment) Act, No. 21 of 2017.\n\n2.Section 5 of the Urban Councils Ordinance (Chapter255) is hereby repealed and the following section substitutedtherefor:\u2014\n\n5.(1) Each Urban Council shall consist ofsuch number of Councillors\u2014\n\n(a)equivalent to sixty per centum of thenumber of Councillors to be electedand returned, for such UrbanCouncil, as specified by the Ministerby Order published in the Gazette,based on the number of wardsspecified in the Orders publishedunder sections 3C and 3D of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262);\n\n(b)equivalent to forty per centum of thenumber of Councillors to be electedand returned for such UrbanCouncil, who shall be returned interms of section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262); and\n\nShort title.\n\nReplacement ofsection 5 ofChapter 255.\n\n\u201cCompositionof UrbanCouncils.\n\nUrban Councils (Amendment)Act, No. 21 of 20172\n\n(c)determined by the Commissionerunder paragraph (a) of subsection (4)of section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262)."
