    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nDIVINEGUMA(AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 2 OF 2017\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 21st February, 2017]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of February 23, 2017\n\n1Divineguma (Amendment) Act, No. 2 of 2017\n\n2\u2014PL 004927\u20142961 (12/2016)\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 21st February, 2017]\n\nL. D.\u2014O. 58/2015.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE DIVINEGUMAACT, NO. 1 OF 2013\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Divineguma(Amendment) Act, No. 2 of 2017.\n\n2.The Long title to the Divineguma Act, No. 1 of 2013(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended as follows:\u2014\n\n(1)by the substitution for the expression \u201cDEPARTMENTOF DIVINEGUMA DEVELOPMENT\u201d of theexpression \u201cDEPARTMENT OF SAMURDHIDEVELOPMENT\u201d; and\n\n(2)by the substitution for the word \u201cDIVINEGUMA\u201dof the word \u201cSAMURDHI\u201d.\n\n3.The second paragraph of the Preamble of the principalenactment is hereby amended by the substitution for thewords \u201cAND WHEREAS, Divineguma intends\u201d of the words\u201cAND WHEREAS, Samurdhi intends\u201d.\n\n4.(1) In the principal enactment and any other writtenlaw there shall be substituted\u2014.\n\n(a)for the expression \u201cDepartment of DivinegumaDevelopment\u201d of the expression \u201cDepartment ofSamurdhi Development\u201d;\n\nAmendment ofthe Long title toAct, No. 1 of2013.\n\nAmendment ofthe Preamble ofthe principalenactment.\n\nGeneralamendments tothe principalenactment andother writtenlaw.\n\nDivineguma (Amendment) Act, No. 2 of 20172\n\n(b)for the expression \u201cDivineguma National Council\u201dof the expression \u201cSamurdhi National Council\u201d;\n\n(c)for the expression \u201cdivineguma community basedorganizations\u201d of the expression \u201csamurdhicommunity based organizations\u201d;"
